    "input": "search_document: # International Orders 1. **Shipping Costs and Thresholds**: Northwind Outdoor charges a flat shipping fee of $45.00 for all international orders under $150.00. For orders totaling $150.00 or more, standard international shipping is free. This threshold applies to the subtotal before any discounts are applied. Customers must select their country at checkout to see the exact delivery estimate, which typically ranges from 7 to 14 business days depending on the destination. 2. **Customs Duties and Taxes**: All international shipments are subject to local customs duties, import taxes, and handling fees. These charges are calculated by the carrier and are not included in the Northwind Outdoor checkout total.",
